---
import Diagram from '../Diagram.astro';
---
<Diagram caption="The whole cutover. Both WANs stay physically connected on the same LAN; the only thing that changes is where the core points its default route — which is also the whole rollback.">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 720 340" role="img" aria-labelledby="coexTitle coexDesc">
    <title id="coexTitle">Legacy WAN and SD-WAN coexistence, before and after cutover</title>
    <desc id="coexDesc">
      Before cutover, the site core points its default route at the legacy WAN router and
      the Meraki HA pair sits connected but unused. After cutover, the default route points
      at the Meraki virtual IP and the legacy router stays connected but idle. Nothing else
      about the site changes.
    </desc>

    <!-- BEFORE -->
    <rect class="panel" x="16" y="14" width="320" height="310" rx="12" />
    <text class="panel-title" x="36" y="40">BEFORE CUTOVER</text>

    <rect class="node" x="106" y="58" width="140" height="42" rx="8" />
    <text class="label" x="146" y="85">Site core</text>

    <path class="link-active" d="M140 100 L140 150 L106 150 L106 186" />
    <text class="tag" x="36" y="136">0.0.0.0/0</text>

    <path class="link-dim" d="M212 100 L212 150 L250 150 L250 186" />

    <rect class="node" x="36" y="186" width="140" height="58" rx="8" />
    <text class="label" x="56" y="212">Legacy WAN</text>
    <text class="sub" x="56" y="230">x.x.x.4 · in use</text>

    <rect class="node" x="182" y="186" width="140" height="58" rx="8" />
    <text class="label" x="202" y="212">Meraki VIP</text>
    <text class="sub" x="202" y="230">x.x.x.254 · idle</text>

    <text class="sub" x="36" y="280">Validate the new path while</text>
    <text class="sub" x="36" y="298">production still rides the old one.</text>

    <!-- arrow between panels -->
    <path class="link-active" d="M348 170 L376 170" />
    <path class="link-active" d="M368 163 L376 170 L368 177" />

    <!-- AFTER -->
    <rect class="panel" x="388" y="14" width="316" height="310" rx="12" />
    <text class="panel-title" x="408" y="40">AFTER CUTOVER</text>

    <rect class="node" x="476" y="58" width="140" height="42" rx="8" />
    <text class="label" x="516" y="85">Site core</text>

    <path class="link-dim" d="M510 100 L510 150 L476 150 L476 186" />

    <path class="link-active" d="M582 100 L582 150 L620 150 L620 186" />
    <text class="tag" x="612" y="136">0.0.0.0/0</text>

    <rect class="node" x="406" y="186" width="140" height="58" rx="8" />
    <text class="label" x="426" y="212">Legacy WAN</text>
    <text class="sub" x="426" y="230">x.x.x.4 · still cabled</text>

    <rect class="node-edge" x="552" y="186" width="140" height="58" rx="8" />
    <text class="label" x="572" y="212">Meraki VIP</text>
    <text class="sub" x="572" y="230">x.x.x.254 · in use</text>

    <text class="sub" x="408" y="280">Rollback is the same change,</text>
    <text class="sub" x="408" y="298">pointed back the other way.</text>
  </svg>
</Diagram>
